(7582879, 1220629, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the lines and curves in this abstract study of shapes and light &amp; shadow! The sphere is nestled in the flowing curves of the undulating paper. The B&amp;W really calls focus on the play of light and shadow as well as how it highlight the shapes and lines in this capture. Beautifully done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the lines and curves in this abstract study of shapes and light & shadow! The sphere is nestled in the flowing curves of the undulating paper. The B&W really calls focus on the play of light and shadow as well as how it highlight the shapes and lines in this capture. Beautifully done!', '2018-07-16 12:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582884, 1220152, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the juxtaposition of the black and white snake with curling locks that spread out like a halo around the woman laying on the floor! The paired imagery strongly invokes the idea of the Medusa from Greek Mythology. Composition of main subjects, detail, and lighting are all fantastic in conceptual portrait!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the juxtaposition of the black and white snake with curling locks that spread out like a halo around the woman laying on the floor! The paired imagery strongly invokes the idea of the Medusa from Greek Mythology. Composition of main subjects, detail, and lighting are all fantastic in conceptual portrait!', '2018-07-16 12:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7582888, 1220737, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>My eye travels along the curves and bends in the road following it down to discover the spectacular clouds blanketing the valley below and rolling over the hills! Wonderfully presented scenery that perfectly captures the sinuous nature of this curving road in the gorgeous countryside!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. My eye travels along the curves and bends in the road following it down to discover the spectacular clouds blanketing the valley below and rolling over the hills! Wonderfully presented scenery that perfectly captures the sinuous nature of this curving road in the gorgeous countryside!', '2018-07-16 12:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
