(7583195, 1219955, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love this over head view of where the land meets the sea! Fantastic composition that shows the sinuous/undulating shoreline and footpath moving on a diagonal from the bottom left corner to the top right corner. Love the details too! We get to see the ripples on the ocean surface and the lined patterns in the grassy areas near the large house. Wonderful work that captures a perspective one rarely gets to see!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love this over head view of where the land meets the sea! Fantastic composition that shows the sinuous/undulating shoreline and footpath moving on a diagonal from the bottom left corner to the top right corner. Love the details too! We get to see the ripples on the ocean surface and the lined patterns in the grassy areas near the large house. Wonderful work that captures a perspective one rarely gets to see!', '2018-07-17 11:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583254, 1220577, 88492, '<td valign="top">I wanted it to have a forked tongue.</td>', 'I wanted it to have a forked tongue.', '2018-07-17 13:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583368, 1220153, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>What a fantastic find! Love the repeating ''S'' shapes in the circular staircases! Another great visual element is the colors -  a bold orange, a spring green, and caribbean blue! An awesome study of shapes and curves lines that is well seen and well presented!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. What a fantastic find! Love the repeating ''S'' shapes in the circular staircases! Another great visual element is the colors -  a bold orange, a spring green, and caribbean blue! An awesome study of shapes and curves lines that is well seen and well presented!', '2018-07-17 18:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583370, 1220437, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love that pop of red color that contrasts beautifully with the white and black hues of the staircase. The spiraling shape of the staircase leads my eye directly to that red umbrella.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love that pop of red color that contrasts beautifully with the white and black hues of the staircase. The spiraling shape of the staircase leads my eye directly to that red umbrella.', '2018-07-17 18:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583373, 1220420, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love how you composed the shot to capture the twisting curves of the road that goes up this hill! The addition of a car and motorcycle gives the image a sense of scale of how big it it which contrasts with the fantastic tilt shift technique making it feel like I am viewing a miniature/toy world. My one critique is that there is too much vegetation the obscures the road at the top - given the position and height of trees/vegetation it is highly likely that there was no way to get a better shot to include more of the road.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love how you composed the shot to capture the twisting curves of the road that goes up this hill! The addition of a car and motorcycle gives the image a sense of scale of how big it it which contrasts with the fantastic tilt shift technique making it feel like I am viewing a miniature/toy world. My one critique is that there is too much vegetation the obscures the road at the top - given the position and height of trees/vegetation it is highly likely that there was no way to get a better shot to include more of the road.', '2018-07-17 18:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583374, 1219790, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow! The level of details in the scales on the head of this snake is amazing! The colors and patterns on this coiled serpent is very bold and eye-catching too!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wow! The level of details in the scales on the head of this snake is amazing! The colors and patterns on this coiled serpent is very bold and eye-catching too!', '2018-07-17 18:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583537, 1220554, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>A clean minimalist composition with pleasing shapes and soft hues of pale green and white. The lines and curves in this composition are simply elegant and the light greens give it a soft light as air feel. Nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. A clean minimalist composition with pleasing shapes and soft hues of pale green and white. The lines and curves in this composition are simply elegant and the light greens give it a soft light as air feel. Nicely done!', '2018-07-17 23:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583628, 1220437, 9668, '<td valign="top">Brilliant image but says spiral to me rather than serpentine.</td>', 'Brilliant image but says spiral to me rather than serpentine.', '2018-07-18 02:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583648, 1219491, 28742, '<td valign="top">I see the foreman entering on the right, wondering where all his workers ran off to. Now they''ll probably be fired or fined just so you could take this photo. I hope you''re happy.</td>', 'I see the foreman entering on the right, wondering where all his workers ran off to. Now they''ll probably be fired or fined just so you could take this photo. I hope you''re happy.', '2018-07-18 03:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7583739, 1220580, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The black and white really showcases all the details and great contrasts in this twisting path! It took me a moment but I love how you turned things upside down so now my eye follows the line of lights as it emerges from the bottom left corner to snake it''s way to the ''horizon''.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The black and white really showcases all the details and great contrasts in this twisting path! It took me a moment but I love how you turned things upside down so now my eye follows the line of lights as it emerges from the bottom left corner to snake it''s way to the ''horizon''.', '2018-07-18 10:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
