(7584000, 1220579, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment<br/> <br/>A very creative way to use metal wire tubing to create a scene of writhing ''snake-like'' creatures! They rise up from the sand like they just hatched and are reaching up to explore the world sticking their wire tongues out. A creative take to the challenge and one that has alot of great details! I do have one critique and that is the blue tones in the light that falls on the main subject, the sand, and the backdrop lowers the contrasts between the elements. Overall they are all some hue of blue - adding contrasting hues and light would make the imagery visually pop off the backdrop more.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment A very creative way to use metal wire tubing to create a scene of writhing ''snake-like'' creatures! They rise up from the sand like they just hatched and are reaching up to explore the world sticking their wire tongues out. A creative take to the challenge and one that has alot of great details! I do have one critique and that is the blue tones in the light that falls on the main subject, the sand, and the backdrop lowers the contrasts between the elements. Overall they are all some hue of blue - adding contrasting hues and light would make the imagery visually pop off the backdrop more.', '2018-07-18 22:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7584002, 1220651, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Clean minimal conceptual photo that is both fun and playful. I love the little kid that peeks over the table to look for sweets! It plays into the some of the imagery in film and t.v. of a child reaching up at the kitchen counter looking to sneak some cookies out of the cookie jar. Here the colorful candy ''snakes'' it''s way toward the child as he/she patiently waits till it is on edge before chomping on the sugary treats! Nicely done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Clean minimal conceptual photo that is both fun and playful. I love the little kid that peeks over the table to look for sweets! It plays into the some of the imagery in film and t.v. of a child reaching up at the kitchen counter looking to sneak some cookies out of the cookie jar. Here the colorful candy ''snakes'' it''s way toward the child as he/she patiently waits till it is on edge before chomping on the sugary treats! Nicely done!', '2018-07-18 22:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7584004, 1220340, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wonderful long nighttime exposure! The headlights and taillights of cars zooming by on the winding highway becomes ''ribbons of light'' weaving it''s way through the city''s downtown area. Love the sharp clarity, the colors and the composition. The highway path begins at the bottom half of the photo acting as a leading line as it draws my eye further into the city as it snakes its way off to the horizon. Fantastic work!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wonderful long nighttime exposure! The headlights and taillights of cars zooming by on the winding highway becomes ''ribbons of light'' weaving it''s way through the city''s downtown area. Love the sharp clarity, the colors and the composition. The highway path begins at the bottom half of the photo acting as a leading line as it draws my eye further into the city as it snakes its way off to the horizon. Fantastic work!', '2018-07-18 22:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
