(7584520, 1220509, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I really like how the twisting bamboo sprouts from the bottom left corner to stretch diagonally across the frame. My only critique is that the composition could be even stronger if the bamboo was evenly lit all across its surface. Another light positioned behind and below it would illuminate the back portions that fall a bit into shadow.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I really like how the twisting bamboo sprouts from the bottom left corner to stretch diagonally across the frame. My only critique is that the composition could be even stronger if the bamboo was evenly lit all across its surface. Another light positioned behind and below it would illuminate the back portions that fall a bit into shadow.', '2018-07-21 20:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
